# Local fish overrides — deliberately not overwritten by chezmoi.
#
# Sourced last by ~/.config/fish/config.fish; the fish counterpart of
# ~/.zshrc.local, and created once by chezmoi's `create_` attribute so local
# edits and installer appends survive `chezmoi apply`.
#
# Anything that turns out to be permanent belongs back in the repo instead:
# conf.d/00-env.fish for PATH and env vars needed by every fish shell, or
# another conf.d fragment for interactive-only setup.
